! ============================================================================
!  IEEE 13-Node Test Feeder - Line Codes
! ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
!  A "LineCode" stores the per-unit-length series impedance (R, X) and shunt
!  capacitance (C) matrices of a given conductor configuration. Lines then
!  reference a LineCode instead of repeating the matrices, and OpenDSS scales
!  the matrices by each line's Length.
!
!  Matrices are given in lower-triangular form:  (row1 | row2 | row3)
!  Units are ohms per mile (r/x) and nF per mile (C).
! ============================================================================

New linecode.601 nphases=3 units=mi
~ rmatrix = (0.3465 | 0.1560 0.3375 | 0.1580 0.1535 0.3414)
~ xmatrix = (1.0179 | 0.5017 1.0478 | 0.4236 0.3849 1.0348)
~ cmatrix = (6.2998 | -1.9958 5.9597 | -1.2595 -0.7417 5.6386)

